     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Winston,<br><br>Thank you very much for your reply. I have already posted it to the issue tracker.<br><br>Regards,<br>Yang<br><br>在 2015年2月18日星期三 UTC+1下午9:44:02，Winston Chang写道：<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><span><div dir=\"ltr\">I think that&#39;s a bug. Could you file an issue in the issue tracker?<div>  <a href=\"https://github.com/rstudio/shiny/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/rstudio/shiny/issues&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792400246516000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1HE-dq4qItFOUqK063ceAb\">https://github.com/rstudio/<u></u>shiny/issues</a></div><div><br></div></div></span><div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><span>On Tue, Feb 17, 2015 at 3:12 PM, Yuanzhe Yang <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">yyz...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br></span><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><span><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi there,<br><br>I am using Shiny to visualize some statistics. The UI has to be in multiple languages such that the entire context switches as the language selection is triggered. So this is what I am doing:<br><br>I have defined some named lists to store the texts in corresponding languages and I have defined the following select input and slider input fields in ui.R with initial values in a default language:<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">selectInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;clsLev&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> clsLevLabel$nl</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> levList$nl</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> levList$nl</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]]),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>sliderInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;numRes&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> numResLabel$nl</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> min </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> max </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">50</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> value </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">20</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> step </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span></div></code></div><br>Language selection is also controlled by a select input field:<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">selectInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;lang&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> langLabel$nl</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;en&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;nl&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;fr&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;de&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;nl&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><br>Accordingly, in server.R I defined an observer to update the two input fields when &quot;input$lang&quot; changes, as follows:<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">observe</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    updateSelectInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">session</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;clsLev&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> label </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> clsLevLabel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$lang</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]],</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> choices </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> levList</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$lang</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]])</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    updateSliderInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">session</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;numRes&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> label </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> numResLabel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$lang</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]])</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span></div></code></div><br>I think I am doing in a right way, however it is very strange that it works only partially: the label of the slider input and the choices of the select input change accordingly, but the label of the select input remains unchanged.<br><br>Is there anyone who has also encountered such kind of issue or am I doing it in a wrong way? Any comment or suggestion will be a great help for me. Thank you in advance.<br><br>Regards,<br>Yang<span><font color=\"#888888\"><br></font></span></div></span><span><font color=\"#888888\"><span>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;Shiny - Web Framework for R&quot; group.<br></span>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a rel=\"nofollow\">shiny-discus...@<u></u>googlegroups.com</a>.<span><br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/3ee4fc25-ef94-4bf2-8366-6614f244fec9%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/3ee4fc25-ef94-4bf2-8366-6614f244fec9%2540googlegroups.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792400246517000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3HAeKpIGLPeuq4IPlMV8By\">https://groups.google.com/d/<u></u>msgid/shiny-discuss/3ee4fc25-<u></u>ef94-4bf2-8366-6614f244fec9%<u></u>40googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792400246517000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1khSaxq_d1r0fJLmGKNPsq\">https://groups.google.